  "prefLabel": "Pda 502.03 Collective mooring area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 502.03 “Collective mooring area” means the shorefront property mooring area of a marina or condominium within which the holder of a commercial mooring for hire mooring permit(s) is authorized to set commercial moorings for hire in accordance with a mooring plan approved by the authority pursuant to Pda 506.09(h).\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (formerly Pda 502.04) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
